nnection", `${a.title} and ${b.title} are directly connected in the archive, but that link alone does not prove a face-to-face meeting.`]);
    if (shared.length) factors.push(["Shared records", `Both connect to ${shared.slice(0, 4).map(entry => entry.title).join(", ")}, which suggests overlapping story context but is still not direct proof.`]);
    if (!factors.length) factors.push(["Archive limit", "No explicit shared event is stored for this pair."]);
    return {
      primary: a,
      related: [b, ...shared],
      html: answerFrame(
        `Have ${a.title} and ${b.title} met?`,
        `The current curated event graph cannot confirm a direct meeting between ${a.title} and ${b.title}.`,
        factors,
        { status: "Unconfirmed encounter", note: "This is deliberately not phrased as 'no.' Missing encounter data is not proof that two characters never met." }
      )
    };
  }

